  "details": "When attempting to enter the following worlds in 1678 open beta, the download gauge screen appears, but the download does not start and you are immediately returned to the home world. Clearing the world data cache does not change the result. Even when preloading, the download does not start and nothing happens. The same result occurs in both VR and desktop modes, and I cannot enter the world.\n\nSwitching from the open beta to the live version 1664 seems to allow me to enter the world without any problems.\n\nWorld Name: GOA˸ Planet of the Lumen Snails\n\nWorld ID: wrld_fd9593ed-f405-462e-8d80-34459b5be581",
